   path that could lose data?
2. Check if Ollama's /api/chat vs /v1/ endpoint difference matters here
   (known issue: /v1/ ignores num_ctx)
3. Look for error logs from that run date (2026-04-07)
4. Determine if this is a one-off or affects other local model runs

